{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-tsx","path":"/blog/2024-11-14--notes-profiling/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"disqus":"edward-j-schwartz"}},"post":{"htmlAst":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"At some point, I hope to create a Notes section on my website that will turn Markdown files into a list of notes. This is basically how the blog works. But, I'm kind of busy. And since Gatsby seems like it's dead, I'm not sure that I want to invest a whole lot of time into it. (Although putting the notes in markdown seems like a good idea for compatibility.)"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Anyway, here is my first very short note on Profiling."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"h2","properties":{"id":"speedscope","style":"position:relative;"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#speedscope","ariaLabel":"speedscope permalink","className":["anchor","before"]},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"svg","properties":{"ariaHidden":"true","focusable":"false","height":"16","version":"1.1","viewBox":"0 0 16 16","width":"16"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"path","properties":{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z"},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"SpeedScope"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://www.speedscope.app/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"SpeedScope"}]},{"type":"text","value":" is an awesome tool for visualizing\nprofiler output.  It has a flame graph view that is wonderful.  I also like to\nuse the Sandwich view, sorting by total time and simply looking for the first\nfunction that I recognize.  This is often the culprit."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://github.com/jlfwong/speedscope#usage"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"documentation"}]},{"type":"text","value":" is pretty good.\nIt also shows how to record profiles in compatible formats for most platforms.\nI mostly use "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{"className":["language-text"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"py-spy"}]},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{"className":["language-text"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"perf"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"h3","properties":{"id":"java","style":"position:relative;"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#java","ariaLabel":"java permalink","className":["anchor","before"]},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"svg","properties":{"ariaHidden":"true","focusable":"false","height":"16","version":"1.1","viewBox":"0 0 16 16","width":"16"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"path","properties":{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z"},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"Java"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The one notably missing platform is Java!  Luckily, it's not too hard to convert Java's async-profiler output to a format that SpeedScope can read.  Here's how I do it:"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Download "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://github.com/async-profiler/async-profiler"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"async-profiler"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create an output file in "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{"className":["language-text"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"collapsed"}]},{"type":"text","value":" format"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can do this in several ways, such as:"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{"className":["language-text"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"./asprof start -i 1s Ghidra"}]},{"type":"text","value":" followed by "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{"className":["language-text"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"./asprof stop -o collapsed -f /tmp/out.prof.collapsed Ghidra"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{"className":["language-text"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"./asprof collect -d 60 -o collapsed -f /tmp/out.prof.collapsed Ghidra"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Then open "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{"className":["language-text"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"out.prof.collapsed"}]},{"type":"text","value":" in SpeedScope."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"div","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"fsclick","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"figure","properties":{"className":["gatsby-resp-image-figure"],"style":""},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n    "},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"className":["gatsby-resp-image-wrapper"],"style":"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 1437px; "},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n      "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"className":["gatsby-resp-image-link"],"href":"/static/ebd79983ac72bcaee00df0c4edd8ef0e/bed7a/image.png","style":"display: block","target":"_blank","rel":["noopener"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n    "},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"className":["gatsby-resp-image-background-image"],"style":"padding-bottom: 68.22222222222221%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;"},"children":[]},{"type":"text","value":"\n  "},{"type":"element","tagName":"picture","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n          "},{"type":"element","tagName":"source","properties":{"srcSet":["/static/ebd79983ac72bcaee00df0c4edd8ef0e/e46ac/image.avif 450w","/static/ebd79983ac72bcaee00df0c4edd8ef0e/9b8d4/image.avif 900w","/static/ebd79983ac72bcaee00df0c4edd8ef0e/e2f16/image.avif 1437w"],"sizes":"(max-width: 1437px) 100vw, 1437px","type":"image/avif"},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tagName":"source","properties":{"srcSet":["/static/ebd79983ac72bcaee00df0c4edd8ef0e/8626f/image.webp 450w","/static/ebd79983ac72bcaee00df0c4edd8ef0e/131f1/image.webp 900w","/static/ebd79983ac72bcaee00df0c4edd8ef0e/00f91/image.webp 1437w"],"sizes":"(max-width: 1437px) 100vw, 1437px","type":"image/webp"}